         return (
-            "Outcome-Driven Innovation moves in five moves. Here is the job, mapped "
-            "to the eight universal stages, so you can see where the friction lives.",
+            "Here is the work behind the scenes: the steps the customer goes through, "
+            "so you can see where the friction lives.",
             [guidelines_spec()],
         )

